abstract: "Portable governance kit for AI-written code: a cross-model review gate (builder ≠ reviewer, fail-closed, humans merge), isolated worktrees, encrypted secrets, git-versioned agent memory, fleet digest, automation prompts, and a multi-harness token dashboard. Bash-only; works with any coding agent that reads AGENTS.md."
